     Software events are used to collect various source of software events.

   PPMMCC FFeeaattuurreess
     16 sampling counters using software events based on various sources.
     These PMCs support the following capabilities:

     _C_a_p_a_b_i_l_i_t_y           _S_u_p_p_o_r_t
     PMC_CAP_CASCADE      No
     PMC_CAP_EDGE         No
     PMC_CAP_INTERRUPT    Yes
     PMC_CAP_INVERT       No
     PMC_CAP_READ         Yes
     PMC_CAP_PRECISE      No
     PMC_CAP_SYSTEM       Yes
     PMC_CAP_TAGGING      No
     PMC_CAP_THRESHOLD    No
     PMC_CAP_USER         Yes
     PMC_CAP_WRITE        Yes

   EEvveenntt QQuuaalliiffiieerrss
     There is no supported event qualifier.

     The event specifiers supported by software are:

     CLOCK.HARD
             Hard clock ticks.

     CLOCK.STAT
             Stat clock ticks.

     CLOCK.PROF
             Profiling clock ticks.

     INTR.ALL
             Interrupt filter executed

     INTR.FILTER
             Interrupt filter returned FILTER_HANDLED.

     INTR.ITHREAD
             Interrupt filter returned FILTER_SCHEDULE_ITHREAD.

     INTR.SCHEDULE
             Ithread scheduled.

     INTR.STRAY
             Interrupt filter returned FILTER_STRAY.

     INTR.WAITING
             Ithread not scheduled, already active.

     LOCK.FAILED
             Lock acquisition failed.

     PAGE_FAULT.ALL
             All page fault type.

     PAGE_FAULT.READ
             Read page fault.

     PAGE_FAULT.WRITE
             Write page fault.

